<h2 style="margin: 0; display: flex; gap: 0.5em; font-weight: 700; font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 56px); line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -0.01em; text-transform: uppercase"><span style="flex: none; min-width: 1.35em; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums">08</span><span>MiniMax H3 Max + Sunburst 2.5</span></h2>
